    "result_text": "`AcceptanceTest` is the only test, and the full suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `selfLink` field on owners, returned as `/api/owners/` + the owner id.\n\nThe `OwnerDto` is generated from `openapi.yml` at build time and populated by MapStruct via `OwnerMapper`, so the change follows that existing pattern (matching how sibling computed read-only fields like `displayName`, `customerCode`, and `fiscalYear` work):\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `selfLink` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema.\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct mapping computing it as `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null-safe when the id is absent).\n\nThis surfaces `selfLink` on every owner response, including `GET /api/owners/{id}` which the acceptance test reads back. `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**.",
